WEBVTT

00:23.040 --> 00:26.840
SHANGHAI, SEVEN MONTHS AGO

00:51.720 --> 00:52.840
Has she gone in?

00:55.000 --> 00:56.520
Right on time, Mr. Ji.

00:56.600 --> 00:57.480
You only appear

00:57.560 --> 00:59.440
when it's about time to apply anesthesia.

00:59.520 --> 01:00.400
How is she?

01:00.480 --> 01:01.480
Who?

01:01.560 --> 01:02.560
Jamie.

01:04.680 --> 01:06.480
You're not in France yet.

01:06.560 --> 01:07.600
Speak Mandarin.

01:14.880 --> 01:15.920
Tell Zhuang Jie for me.

01:17.000 --> 01:19.000
I'll contact her
once I'm settled in France.

01:19.600 --> 01:20.600
There will be ample time.

01:22.400 --> 01:24.280
Zhuang Jie also asked me to tell you.

01:24.360 --> 01:25.560
"Life is too short.

01:25.640 --> 01:26.560
I wish you happiness."

01:29.240 --> 01:32.400
Even when I'm in France, I'll still
be your direct superior, Wang Xixia.

01:32.480 --> 01:33.320
So what?

01:33.400 --> 01:35.320
So whatever it is
between Zhuang Jie and me,

01:35.840 --> 01:37.440
please keep out of it.

01:37.520 --> 01:38.920
You and Zhuang Jie?

01:39.000 --> 01:40.160
What's between you two?

01:41.400 --> 01:43.680
Wasn't it just a three-year situation
without a label?

01:43.760 --> 01:45.520
You fled as soon as she wanted a label.

01:46.360 --> 01:47.360
What's wrong?

01:47.440 --> 01:48.720
Are these flowers to commemorate

01:48.800 --> 01:50.720
your premature love that ended too soon?

03:38.160 --> 03:43.000
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

03:50.920 --> 03:52.400
JI TONG

03:52.480 --> 03:54.160
Jie, are you going to record?

03:54.240 --> 03:55.360
You have to work with me,

03:55.440 --> 03:56.680
like it's the real thing.

03:56.760 --> 03:57.600
Okay.

03:59.560 --> 04:01.440
Let me check the equipment for you.

04:02.560 --> 04:03.440
Not bad.

04:04.160 --> 04:05.160
Lighting, check.

04:05.240 --> 04:06.440
Internet connection, check.

04:07.400 --> 04:10.080
Battery, check.

04:10.160 --> 04:12.080
Let me go through the script
for you again.

04:12.160 --> 04:13.320
You have to memorize it later.

04:13.400 --> 04:14.360
Be like me.

04:14.440 --> 04:15.440
Vivid expressions and…

04:15.520 --> 04:16.839
Zhuang Jie.

04:16.920 --> 04:18.760
Ji Tong may not have moved on from you.

04:18.839 --> 04:20.240
Forget it.

04:20.320 --> 04:21.360
The best thing about me

04:21.440 --> 04:22.960
is I know my own worth.

04:23.520 --> 04:24.680
I mean it.

04:24.760 --> 04:26.200
On the day I came back,

04:26.280 --> 04:27.680
we had an unpleasant chat.

04:27.760 --> 04:29.600
I told him you had a boyfriend.

04:30.440 --> 04:34.440
SHANGHAI, LAST WEEK

04:34.520 --> 04:35.520
Mr. Ji.

04:37.000 --> 04:38.600
Don't pretend to be busy. Let's chat.

04:41.360 --> 04:42.240
Wang Xixia.

04:45.080 --> 04:46.720
I told you.

04:46.800 --> 04:48.880
Even if I go to France,
I'm still your direct superior.

04:51.480 --> 04:52.320
So?

04:52.400 --> 04:54.680
HQ wants you to work with me
to train some newbies.

04:55.280 --> 04:56.560
I haven't seen you in two days.

04:57.240 --> 04:59.080
Didn't the administration tell you?

04:59.160 --> 05:00.720
My annual leave starts today.

05:00.800 --> 05:02.320
Are you avoiding me?

05:03.320 --> 05:04.760
Mr. Ji, it's quite weird

05:04.840 --> 05:06.240
to phrase it that way.

05:06.320 --> 05:08.320
There's no need for us
to beat around the bush.

05:08.400 --> 05:09.240
I know.

05:09.320 --> 05:10.560
Zhuang Jie is on vacation

05:11.480 --> 05:12.640
because I hurt her badly.

05:13.880 --> 05:16.320
Aren't you a bit narcissistic?

05:16.400 --> 05:17.240
Don't say that.

05:18.200 --> 05:19.640
I really care about her.

05:20.200 --> 05:21.440
If I knew something would happen

05:21.520 --> 05:22.680
to Zhuang Jie's stepfather,

05:22.760 --> 05:23.600
I would have--

05:23.680 --> 05:24.880
Kept stringing her along?

05:25.560 --> 05:26.560
Quit it.

05:26.640 --> 05:27.680
Zhuang Jie is on vacation

05:27.760 --> 05:29.280
to rest after her surgery.

05:29.360 --> 05:30.400
Your relationship with her

05:30.480 --> 05:32.400
has been tossed out
along with the medical waste.

05:32.480 --> 05:33.520
Moreover,

05:33.600 --> 05:34.800
she has a boyfriend now.

05:44.080 --> 05:45.080
What an attractive couple.

05:45.160 --> 05:46.040
A match made in heaven.

05:51.360 --> 05:52.640
Is he from your hometown?

05:56.000 --> 05:58.400
Handsome. Super attentive.

05:58.480 --> 05:59.480
Treats her well.

06:00.120 --> 06:01.600
From now on, Zhuang Jie's business

06:01.680 --> 06:02.640
is none of your concern.

06:09.200 --> 06:10.320
Wang Xixia,

06:10.400 --> 06:11.760
we are both sensible people.

06:11.840 --> 06:13.000
Why are you so hateful?

06:13.560 --> 06:15.880
If Zhuang Jie will abandon me and Shanghai

06:15.960 --> 06:17.080
for a hometown man,

06:18.520 --> 06:20.160
I'll change my last name.

06:29.920 --> 06:31.000
Are you serious?

06:31.080 --> 06:33.200
I wanted to get back at him.

06:33.280 --> 06:35.160
But I think he still cares about you.

06:35.240 --> 06:36.280
It's not my concern.

06:36.800 --> 06:38.320
Have you really moved on?

06:38.400 --> 06:39.440
Why would I lie about it?

06:39.520 --> 06:40.520
That's good to hear.

06:45.520 --> 06:46.680
Done.

06:48.080 --> 06:49.360
Jie, bring the chicken.

06:51.520 --> 06:53.080
Hello! Get the chicken.

06:54.600 --> 06:56.480
Why are you so absent-minded tonight?

06:58.600 --> 06:59.800
If you aren't feeling it,

06:59.880 --> 07:01.120
we can get another anchor.

07:01.920 --> 07:03.360
But you must reflect on it properly.

07:03.440 --> 07:05.640
We need to have a serious meeting later.

07:09.400 --> 07:10.760
Are you really feeling out of it?

07:10.840 --> 07:12.120
Then let Ms. Liao Tao do it.

07:15.800 --> 07:16.680
She's busy.

07:16.760 --> 07:18.360
Let Jisan Goose deal with it first.

07:23.000 --> 07:24.320
Hey, come back.

07:25.200 --> 07:26.920
Jie! Zhuang Jie!

07:35.120 --> 07:36.160
Jie,

07:36.240 --> 07:38.760
I am very dissatisfied
with your performance today.

07:38.840 --> 07:40.800
I worked so hard,
but you didn't cooperate with me.

07:40.880 --> 07:43.160
I'm sorry, Niaoniao.
I'm really off my game today.

07:43.240 --> 07:45.480
Next time. I will definitely
do better next time.

07:45.560 --> 07:46.840
Next time.

07:47.440 --> 07:48.800
There will be no next time.

07:53.400 --> 07:54.920
Sorry.

07:56.520 --> 07:58.320
It's my fault today.

07:58.400 --> 07:59.800
I held you back.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.280
It's not entirely your fault.

08:03.520 --> 08:05.960
Everyone has their strengths
and weaknesses.

08:06.040 --> 08:07.520
I might as well study hard.

08:08.960 --> 08:10.240
I support you.

08:10.320 --> 08:11.920
Let's first be a good student.

08:12.000 --> 08:14.160
You can take your time
if you want to start a business.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.120
There's no rush.

08:18.320 --> 08:19.320
Jie.

08:21.080 --> 08:22.800
There's something wrong with you today.

08:24.000 --> 08:25.680
There's always something wrong.

08:25.760 --> 08:26.880
Don't interrupt.

08:26.960 --> 08:29.360
I mean you have something on your mind.

08:32.799 --> 08:34.840
Tell me. I won't tell Mom.

08:46.240 --> 08:47.240
Do you remember

08:48.440 --> 08:50.080
a colleague I mentioned before?

08:51.560 --> 08:53.080
He's called Ji Tong. Your boss.

08:53.840 --> 08:56.200
Your ability to remember gossip
is exceptional.

08:56.720 --> 08:57.680
What about him?

08:57.760 --> 08:58.920
He came back to China.

08:59.000 --> 09:01.280
He's staying for half a month
to train new employees.

09:01.360 --> 09:03.000
He heard something happened to our family,

09:03.080 --> 09:04.600
so he called to see how I was doing.

09:05.920 --> 09:07.120
Was that all?

09:08.280 --> 09:09.440
He wants to see me.

09:10.000 --> 09:11.160
No way.

09:11.240 --> 09:12.120
Why?

09:13.080 --> 09:15.200
How can he leave
and see you whenever he wishes?

09:16.200 --> 09:18.040
He did nothing to help when we needed it.

09:18.960 --> 09:19.960
You're right, Niaoniao.

09:24.240 --> 09:25.080
Jie.

09:27.600 --> 09:28.920
I've always wanted to ask you.

09:31.360 --> 09:33.160
In the first few days after my dad died,

09:33.880 --> 09:35.280
you didn't shed a single tear.

09:36.880 --> 09:38.440
But I don't believe you weren't upset.

09:39.560 --> 09:41.120
How did you get through it?

09:41.200 --> 09:42.080
Did somebody help you?

09:44.080 --> 09:44.920
Of course.

09:45.640 --> 09:46.680
During such times,

09:46.760 --> 09:48.160
no one could bear it

09:48.240 --> 09:49.400
without help from others.

09:53.040 --> 09:53.920
So,

09:55.400 --> 09:56.440
you should be with those

09:56.520 --> 09:57.760
who help in times of need.

09:59.360 --> 10:01.080
Those who are only around
during good times?

10:01.160 --> 10:02.360
You don't need them.

10:27.960 --> 10:31.920
YONGDA PLAZA

10:33.280 --> 10:35.240
Can't you make up your mind
about the underwear?

10:35.320 --> 10:36.920
Shush. Do you want everyone to know?

10:37.000 --> 10:37.920
Am I wrong?

10:38.000 --> 10:40.280
Like a pervert,
you've been here for half an hour.

10:41.160 --> 10:43.000
Well, I'm just inexperienced.

10:43.080 --> 10:44.280
I didn't know men's underwear

10:44.360 --> 10:45.800
came in so many styles.

10:45.880 --> 10:46.840
Just randomly pick some.

10:46.920 --> 10:48.600
Get some boxers. Get some briefs.

10:48.680 --> 10:49.960
Get him a few of each, okay?

10:50.040 --> 10:50.880
You do it.

10:52.040 --> 10:53.120
This looks good.

10:53.720 --> 10:54.560
This one is also…

10:57.000 --> 10:58.960
No wonder you can't get enough of it.

11:00.200 --> 11:01.360
Just choose one for him.

11:08.880 --> 11:10.160
Do you guys know each other too?

11:10.720 --> 11:12.000
"Too"?

11:12.080 --> 11:14.120
I didn't have time
to introduce myself last time.

11:14.200 --> 11:15.240
Cui Ge.

11:16.560 --> 11:18.480
That man is in his thirties.

11:18.560 --> 11:21.080
He claimed to be
from a family of TCM practitioners.

11:21.160 --> 11:22.640
He had a whole entourage.

11:22.720 --> 11:24.520
And do you know what his name is?

11:24.600 --> 11:26.040
Cui Ge.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.840
As if he were a big shot.

11:27.920 --> 11:29.440
Who calls themselves that?

11:31.160 --> 11:32.200
Ge as in "boss"?

11:32.280 --> 11:33.120
Ge as in "song".

11:37.880 --> 11:39.240
Do you like this?

11:40.720 --> 11:42.200
No, you do.

11:43.400 --> 11:44.560
I haven't tried them before.

11:47.680 --> 11:48.760
-Let me help you.
-It's okay.

11:49.360 --> 11:50.280
What a chance meeting.

11:50.360 --> 11:51.280
Shall we have a meal?

11:51.360 --> 11:52.840
No way.

12:03.920 --> 12:06.480
RAISING BOYS, RAISING GOOD CHILDREN
WITHOUT BEATING OR SCOLDING

12:12.640 --> 12:13.920
Was this sent by Zhuang Jie?

12:39.720 --> 12:41.120
What do you want to eat tonight?

12:41.600 --> 12:42.600
Anything is fine.

12:42.680 --> 12:43.760
Do as you like.

12:53.080 --> 12:55.080
Is there anything you want to say to me?

12:57.120 --> 12:58.040
Like what?

13:01.680 --> 13:02.880
What's going on?

13:05.800 --> 13:07.640
I asked Zhuang Jie
to buy some clothes for me.

13:07.720 --> 13:08.760
I've been busy recently.

13:09.920 --> 13:10.920
What is this?

13:12.680 --> 13:13.840
Underwear.

13:14.800 --> 13:16.600
Did you ask Jie to buy underwear for you?

13:17.160 --> 13:18.160
She didn't refuse me.

13:18.240 --> 13:21.320
That's because Jie has a big heart.

13:21.400 --> 13:23.240
You little rascal.

13:23.320 --> 13:24.400
Who do you think you are?

13:24.480 --> 13:26.280
You made an unmarried girl

13:26.360 --> 13:27.520
buy underwear for you!

13:27.600 --> 13:29.120
What's wrong with that?

13:29.200 --> 13:30.960
You!

13:31.040 --> 13:33.440
You should be sentenced!

13:33.520 --> 13:35.360
Are you even treating her like a woman?

13:36.880 --> 13:38.080
That's really not the case.

13:39.920 --> 13:40.840
Never mind.

13:41.360 --> 13:42.600
You heartless thing.

13:43.240 --> 13:44.560
You aren't worthy of Jie.

13:45.120 --> 13:46.680
Do you like her that much?

13:48.600 --> 13:49.960
Is there a point in me liking her?

13:51.280 --> 13:52.280
Sure.

13:53.160 --> 13:54.440
Didn't I tell you?

13:55.240 --> 13:56.360
Finding a partner for me

13:56.440 --> 13:57.720
is all up to you.

14:00.080 --> 14:01.160
Whoever you like,

14:02.520 --> 14:03.600
I will marry them.

14:13.440 --> 14:14.520
I told you.

14:14.600 --> 14:16.240
You need to move more.

14:16.320 --> 14:17.600
You're walking too slowly,

14:17.680 --> 14:18.840
just like an old lady.

14:22.480 --> 14:23.320
Hold on.

14:25.640 --> 14:26.640
Let me take a break.

14:27.320 --> 14:28.440
Take it easy.

14:32.040 --> 14:33.040
The way I see it,

14:33.120 --> 14:34.280
the weather is changing.

14:34.920 --> 14:37.360
Nothing feels right in this body.

14:38.040 --> 14:39.160
I can't sleep well either.

14:39.720 --> 14:42.040
Your problem
has nothing to do with the weather.

14:42.120 --> 14:43.800
It has everything
to do with your grandson.

14:45.320 --> 14:46.160
True.

14:47.880 --> 14:49.240
When Maidong

14:50.000 --> 14:51.520
wasn't even remotely interested in Jie,

14:53.320 --> 14:54.280
I scolded him every day.

14:55.000 --> 14:57.000
Now he is showing a little interest.

14:57.680 --> 14:58.800
I'm afraid instead.

15:00.880 --> 15:02.320
Speaking with my conscience,

15:02.400 --> 15:03.640
Maidong's job

15:04.480 --> 15:05.680
won't scare anyone away.

15:05.760 --> 15:07.680
If he and Jie don't get along,

15:07.760 --> 15:08.720
and he gets hurt again,

15:09.400 --> 15:10.480
he might be devastated.

15:11.160 --> 15:12.120
At that time,

15:12.800 --> 15:14.360
even I won't have the drive to go on.

15:14.440 --> 15:16.480
Stop saying such depressing words.

15:16.560 --> 15:17.680
With your physique,

15:17.760 --> 15:20.200
you will definitely live
to be over 100 years old.

15:20.280 --> 15:22.200
Won't I become an old monster, then?

15:22.280 --> 15:23.920
Stop talking nonsense.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.640
Believe in it.

15:25.720 --> 15:27.960
Good things are coming soon for sure.

15:28.600 --> 15:29.840
I hope so too.

15:30.920 --> 15:33.040
Well, how good would it be

15:33.120 --> 15:34.800
if we could predict our children's lives,

15:34.880 --> 15:36.280
just like the weather forecast?

15:36.840 --> 15:38.120
Come on.

15:38.200 --> 15:40.040
How arrogant are we

15:40.120 --> 15:41.680
to dare predict the weather?

15:42.360 --> 15:45.680
God acts according to his own will.

15:45.760 --> 15:46.680
We're old.

15:46.760 --> 15:48.840
We need to learn to adapt.

15:48.920 --> 15:51.240
If it rains, hold an umbrella.

15:51.320 --> 15:53.480
Put out the quilt to dry
when the sun comes out.

15:53.560 --> 15:55.280
Accept what may come.

15:56.480 --> 15:58.160
And be happy doing it.

15:58.720 --> 15:59.960
Are you serious?

16:00.040 --> 16:00.960
Should I be thankful

16:01.040 --> 16:02.440
for typhoons and earthquakes?

16:02.520 --> 16:05.120
At least, we should learn to be humble.

16:05.200 --> 16:06.640
Know that humans are insignificant.

16:06.720 --> 16:09.360
Many things are out of our control.

16:10.880 --> 16:11.800
What now?

16:11.880 --> 16:13.360
Are you switching careers

16:13.440 --> 16:15.160
from a fortune teller to a philosopher?

16:18.800 --> 16:20.080
All right, let's go.

16:20.160 --> 16:21.480
Let's go back and take a nap.

16:22.960 --> 16:23.920
Slow down.

16:24.840 --> 16:26.680
Time passes really quickly, doesn't it?

16:26.760 --> 16:30.440
When we were young,
we held each other's tiny hands.

16:30.520 --> 16:31.400
And now?

16:31.880 --> 16:34.680
-We're holding each other's wrinkly hands.
-Wrinkly hands.

16:55.880 --> 16:57.560
Are you building an emergency room?

16:57.640 --> 16:59.440
You spray too much disinfectant.

16:59.520 --> 17:00.520
The bachelor is here.

17:00.600 --> 17:02.400
The mop is by the door.
Help clean the floor.

17:02.480 --> 17:03.680
Why is your wife like this?

17:04.480 --> 17:05.960
It's better than having no wife.

17:06.040 --> 17:08.040
My mother-in-law is coming
to check our work later.

17:08.119 --> 17:09.119
Hurry up.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.400
If we can't get it clean,

17:10.480 --> 17:11.599
I will become a bachelor too.

17:12.079 --> 17:13.040
Hurry up.

17:19.079 --> 17:19.960
What for?

17:20.040 --> 17:22.880
For the cake or for saving your neck?

17:26.200 --> 17:27.280
What's wrong with your legs?

17:27.359 --> 17:28.920
I told you to stop squatting.

17:29.000 --> 17:29.960
It's too cold in here.

17:30.040 --> 17:32.240
It eventually triggers the phantom pain.

17:33.240 --> 17:34.640
Wasn't that back in high school?

17:34.720 --> 17:35.680
Aren't you healed yet?

17:35.760 --> 17:36.800
You really are ignorant.

17:36.880 --> 17:38.160
This condition can't be cured.

17:38.240 --> 17:39.600
It can only be alleviated.

17:39.680 --> 17:40.680
Hold this.

17:40.760 --> 17:41.600
I'm leaving.

17:43.640 --> 17:44.680
I'll walk you.

17:52.160 --> 17:53.120
Well…

17:54.160 --> 17:55.120
So then…

17:55.200 --> 17:56.040
Sister-in-law.

17:56.840 --> 17:58.440
Spit it out. Don't call me that.

17:58.520 --> 17:59.840
It gives me goosebumps.

17:59.920 --> 18:00.880
I'm being serious.

18:01.600 --> 18:03.080
Last year, my grandma's legs hurt.

18:03.160 --> 18:04.400
She was bedridden.

18:04.480 --> 18:05.920
You gave her some medicinal patches.

18:06.480 --> 18:07.880
Could you get me a few more?

18:08.520 --> 18:11.400
I got them from my mom.

18:11.480 --> 18:12.320
Back in my hometown,

18:12.400 --> 18:14.040
there is a famous Chinese medicine clinic.

18:15.480 --> 18:17.720
A while ago, a wife died
from drinking pesticides.

18:17.800 --> 18:19.720
That's the couple who ran that clinic.

18:19.800 --> 18:21.960
You wouldn't expect it from that man.

18:22.040 --> 18:23.880
On the surface,
he looks like a proper person.

18:23.960 --> 18:25.000
I didn't expect this.

18:25.080 --> 18:27.000
Please stop talking
about other's family affairs.

18:27.720 --> 18:29.840
Could you ask your mom
to get more medicinal patches?

18:29.920 --> 18:30.800
It's urgent.

18:30.880 --> 18:32.200
That stuff is in short supply.

18:32.280 --> 18:33.440
It'll be hard to get it.

18:33.520 --> 18:34.880
Get as many as you can.

18:34.960 --> 18:35.840
I'll even pay double.

18:37.280 --> 18:38.760
What happened to your grandma?

18:38.840 --> 18:39.920
It's not for her.

18:41.000 --> 18:42.720
-Then who?
-Yes. Who needs it?

18:43.400 --> 18:44.680
Spill it.

18:44.760 --> 18:47.040
I need to know
if she is worth troubling my mom.

18:50.520 --> 18:51.360
Zhuang Jie.

18:54.000 --> 18:55.160
Chen Maidong.

18:56.240 --> 18:58.240
You're all grown up! All right.

18:59.160 --> 19:00.360
I'll call my mom right now.

19:00.440 --> 19:02.440
I'll ask her to swing by the clinic
on her way here.

19:02.520 --> 19:03.760
I'll get it done for you.

19:06.720 --> 19:07.640
-Come here.
-What?

19:07.720 --> 19:09.320
-I'm mopping.
-Sit down.

19:09.400 --> 19:10.280
Do that later.

19:10.840 --> 19:11.920
Let me ask you.

19:12.000 --> 19:13.040
What's going on?

19:13.120 --> 19:14.080
What?

19:14.680 --> 19:16.400
Are you playing dumb?

19:16.480 --> 19:18.360
Zhuang Jie? Are you serious?

19:18.440 --> 19:19.960
Do you have an opinion?

19:20.040 --> 19:22.280
No. What can I say?

19:22.960 --> 19:25.560
I think Zhuang Jie is too smart.

19:25.640 --> 19:26.880
You may not be able to play her.

19:27.640 --> 19:29.000
I don't want to play her.

19:34.440 --> 19:36.240
So are you really in love with her?

19:36.320 --> 19:37.760
I'm even more worried, then.

19:37.840 --> 19:39.880
It's not easy
for an iron tree like you to blossom.

19:39.960 --> 19:41.480
I'm afraid you might wither away.

19:41.560 --> 19:42.880
Can't you just wish me the best?

19:43.520 --> 19:44.480
That's not what I mean.

19:46.040 --> 19:48.360
Chen Maidong, open your eyes.

19:48.440 --> 19:49.680
Do you think Zhuang Jie

19:49.760 --> 19:50.920
will stay in this town?

19:51.720 --> 19:53.640
Is she someone you can live with?

19:53.720 --> 19:55.160
I'm worried that you will be scammed

19:55.240 --> 19:56.440
without even realizing it.

19:58.040 --> 19:59.640
Look at me.

19:59.720 --> 20:01.040
Do I look like I'm worth anything?

20:01.120 --> 20:02.240
Come on.

20:02.320 --> 20:03.960
What's with that mentality?

20:04.040 --> 20:06.400
No matter what,
you were a dashing guy at school.

20:06.480 --> 20:07.840
Don't trample on your own worth.

20:07.920 --> 20:09.280
A woman like Zhuang Jie

20:09.360 --> 20:10.880
has seen and experienced a lot.

20:11.440 --> 20:12.680
Dealing with a woman like her,

20:12.760 --> 20:14.440
you must not rush things.

20:14.520 --> 20:15.760
Don't make yourself her slave.

20:16.720 --> 20:17.760
You're a slave.

20:17.840 --> 20:19.120
You are the cheapest slave.

20:20.600 --> 20:21.640
I'm not a slave.

20:21.720 --> 20:22.880
What I'm doing is "simping."

20:24.000 --> 20:25.320
What are you two doing?

20:39.160 --> 20:41.000
When you go back, try to persuade your mom

20:41.080 --> 20:43.040
not to rush putting her goods
in supermarkets.

20:43.120 --> 20:45.000
Aside from considering foot traffic,

20:45.080 --> 20:46.800
the locations shouldn't be too remote.

20:46.880 --> 20:49.040
I'll ask my cousin's wife later
to investigate for you.

20:49.120 --> 20:51.320
If a shop lot opens up,
I'll let you know first thing.

20:51.400 --> 20:53.800
Okay. My mom has been collecting chickens.

20:53.880 --> 20:56.000
I heard they're all
high-quality free-range chickens.

20:56.080 --> 20:57.560
I'm wondering if we should hire people

20:57.640 --> 20:59.200
to rear chickens on Xingshan Mountain.

20:59.280 --> 21:00.840
But that depends on the town's approval.

21:00.920 --> 21:02.680
Don't be too ambitious, all right?

21:02.760 --> 21:03.880
It's just the two of you.

21:03.960 --> 21:05.080
Take it easy.

21:05.160 --> 21:06.480
There's a lot of pressure.

21:06.560 --> 21:08.440
We invested over 200,000 yuan
in the new factory.

21:08.520 --> 21:11.280
The relative who was seriously injured
was discharged from the hospital.

21:11.360 --> 21:12.800
He asked us for 100,000 yuan

21:12.880 --> 21:14.400
as a settlement.

21:14.480 --> 21:15.760
After all, he is just over 50.

21:15.840 --> 21:17.080
His back was seriously injured.

21:17.160 --> 21:18.680
He can never do heavy lifting again.

21:19.920 --> 21:21.960
Zhuang Jie, even if he is a relative,

21:22.040 --> 21:23.600
you need to draft an agreement.

21:23.680 --> 21:25.280
If there are complications in the future,

21:25.360 --> 21:27.960
your family shouldn't have
to bear more responsibilities and fees.

21:28.600 --> 21:29.880
That's true.

21:29.960 --> 21:32.200
I wanted to hire a lawyer
to notarize the agreement.

21:32.280 --> 21:33.680
But I feel that's too impersonal.

21:34.320 --> 21:36.200
Don't test one's humanity.

21:36.280 --> 21:37.440
Sign it in black and white.

21:37.520 --> 21:38.640
That's the best for everyone.

21:38.720 --> 21:40.400
All right, I'll do as you say.

21:42.640 --> 21:44.000
Okay, you can go back now.

21:44.080 --> 21:45.080
I'm leaving, then.

21:45.160 --> 21:46.680
Don't miss me too much.

21:46.760 --> 21:48.440
I picked just the right time to go back.

21:48.920 --> 21:51.120
I heard that Ji Tong is
on a business trip again.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.160
Don't be too hostile to him.

21:53.240 --> 21:54.600
Things between us are in the past.

21:54.680 --> 21:55.560
Really?

21:55.640 --> 21:57.440
I'm not as tolerant as you.

21:57.520 --> 21:59.080
I rarely dislike anyone.

21:59.160 --> 22:00.560
But if I do,

22:00.640 --> 22:02.280
it's the permanent blacklist for them.

22:03.680 --> 22:04.840
What are you laughing at?

22:05.440 --> 22:06.560
Is Cui Ge on that list?

22:10.320 --> 22:12.080
How dare you mention him?

22:12.160 --> 22:14.040
Did you forget
that I lost my appetite for dinner

22:14.120 --> 22:15.880
after bumping into him
at the mall last time?

22:16.640 --> 22:19.160
But I really think he's quite interesting.

22:19.240 --> 22:20.720
Why don't you try to get to know him?

22:20.800 --> 22:22.680
Shut your mouth. Go home.

22:22.760 --> 22:24.880
-Bye.
-Call me if something happens.

22:28.320 --> 22:30.520
You should give some thought
to that Cui Ge guy.

22:30.600 --> 22:32.760
After all, it's rare to meet Cui Ge.

22:32.840 --> 22:34.040
I'll hit you!

22:34.560 --> 22:35.440
Be careful.

22:36.360 --> 22:37.320
Cui Ge.

22:38.320 --> 22:39.280
Cui Ge.

23:05.760 --> 23:08.840
LIAOGEN CHICKEN

23:11.000 --> 23:12.480
Looking at your phone while walking.

23:12.560 --> 23:14.120
You still have the same old bad habit.

23:18.360 --> 23:19.320
Why are you here?

23:20.320 --> 23:21.560
I came here just to see you.

23:22.360 --> 23:23.240
Are you touched?

23:27.480 --> 23:28.800
I'm a little surprised.

23:28.880 --> 23:29.880
That's great.

23:34.080 --> 23:35.040
Coffee?

23:36.360 --> 23:38.760
I don't think
there is a cafe that you will like here.

23:38.840 --> 23:40.240
No.

23:40.960 --> 23:42.960
On my way here,
the town seemed quite lively.

23:44.080 --> 23:45.560
I need to help my mom with some work.

23:45.640 --> 23:47.160
I'll see you later. Tell me where.

23:47.240 --> 23:49.120
Sure. I'll call you later.

24:19.960 --> 24:22.240
We'll talk at home tonight. Okay?

24:45.120 --> 24:46.200
Mom.

24:47.840 --> 24:49.200
Mom.

24:49.280 --> 24:51.000
Stop calling me.

24:51.720 --> 24:52.600
Lift your feet.

24:53.680 --> 24:55.240
Whenever you spread out that workbook,

24:55.320 --> 24:56.480
you get hungry, thirsty,

24:56.560 --> 24:58.120
or want to go to the toilet.

24:58.200 --> 24:59.480
There's always something.

24:59.560 --> 25:01.280
No, I'm very serious.

25:02.160 --> 25:04.080
I'm stuck on this math problem again.

25:04.160 --> 25:05.960
When is Jie coming back?

25:06.520 --> 25:07.920
How would I know?

25:09.000 --> 25:10.120
She's good.

25:10.800 --> 25:12.000
All grown up now.

25:12.880 --> 25:14.760
The guy even came here to look for her.

25:14.840 --> 25:15.840
And like a fool,

25:15.920 --> 25:17.560
I don't even know his last name.

25:18.520 --> 25:19.880
Does she still see me as her mom?

25:19.960 --> 25:20.840
Really?

25:20.920 --> 25:21.920
That's outrageous!

25:22.000 --> 25:23.680
I was wondering why you are in a bad mood.

25:24.840 --> 25:26.040
Who showed up?

25:27.320 --> 25:28.840
I told you. I don't know.

25:30.160 --> 25:31.280
Anyway, that person

25:31.360 --> 25:33.080
is dressed all prim and proper.

25:33.160 --> 25:34.040
He looks like he wants

25:34.120 --> 25:35.520
to buy the entire Nanping Town.

25:36.200 --> 25:37.560
He came to the storefront.

25:37.640 --> 25:39.160
When he heard your sister wasn't here,

25:39.240 --> 25:41.040
he quickly walked away

25:41.120 --> 25:43.360
as if he was afraid his clothes
would smell like chicken.

25:43.440 --> 25:44.320
That look on his face.

25:44.400 --> 25:45.480
Him?

25:46.880 --> 25:47.920
Do you know him?

25:49.520 --> 25:51.560
Even you don't know. How would I know?

25:51.640 --> 25:52.760
I'm just guessing.

25:52.840 --> 25:54.240
He must be from Shanghai.

25:55.920 --> 25:57.760
I've seen photos of Jie
in their annual meeting.

25:57.840 --> 25:58.960
They all look the same.

25:59.040 --> 26:00.000
All full of vigor.

26:00.080 --> 26:01.520
Your sister is also full of vigor.

26:01.600 --> 26:03.160
Seriously, what is going on?

26:03.240 --> 26:05.360
She even dressed
like she's going on a flower parade.

26:05.440 --> 26:07.320
-She'll freeze to death.
-She'll freeze to death.

26:09.720 --> 26:11.080
Go do your homework.

26:11.160 --> 26:12.800
What does this have to do with you?

26:13.440 --> 26:14.920
All of you are making me worried.

26:21.600 --> 26:23.480
Jie,red alert.

26:23.560 --> 26:25.080
Be careful with your words and actions.

26:40.400 --> 26:42.200
Why did you think of having barbecue?

26:43.160 --> 26:44.760
Whenever you have a meal with Wang Xixia…

26:44.840 --> 26:45.840
Thanks.

26:46.960 --> 26:48.560
Don't you always have

26:48.640 --> 26:50.320
hot pot, skewers, or spicy hot pot?

26:51.360 --> 26:53.000
You don't have to force yourself.

26:53.080 --> 26:55.080
There are Western restaurants in our town.

26:55.160 --> 26:57.920
Sure, they aren't high-end,
but the food tastes good too.

26:58.000 --> 26:59.000
It's okay.

26:59.080 --> 27:00.320
I do as the Romans do.

27:01.640 --> 27:02.960
If I knew you were so easygoing,

27:03.040 --> 27:04.760
I wouldn't wear clothes
that absorb smells.

27:05.400 --> 27:06.320
It looks good.

27:07.000 --> 27:08.120
Also, your attire

27:08.680 --> 27:09.720
matches mine very well.

27:14.760 --> 27:17.280
So you still maintain your old habits.

27:18.880 --> 27:19.760
Catering to me.

27:20.240 --> 27:21.120
Accommodating me.

27:23.440 --> 27:24.960
I've gotten used to it.

27:25.040 --> 27:26.600
After all, you are my boss.

27:27.840 --> 27:29.440
Are you treating me as your boss now?

27:29.920 --> 27:31.880
Didn't you repeatedly tell Wang Xixia?

27:31.960 --> 27:33.440
Even if you went to France,

27:33.520 --> 27:35.680
you are still our direct superior.

27:39.160 --> 27:41.680
Jamie, you should understand.

27:43.600 --> 27:46.640
You are not just a subordinate to me.

28:19.840 --> 28:26.200
INSTRUCTIONS FOR MEDICINAL PATCH

28:30.440 --> 28:34.200
WAIT 48 HOURS BETWEEN USES

28:34.280 --> 28:36.200
SECRET ANCESTRAL RECIPE

28:38.680 --> 28:41.640
IT TAKES FULL EFFECT IN 45 MINUTES

28:52.120 --> 28:53.000
There are some things

28:54.560 --> 28:55.520
that we both understood,

28:55.600 --> 28:57.120
so I never pointed them out.

28:58.000 --> 28:59.800
I thought you would naturally understand.

28:59.880 --> 29:01.960
My family has high expectations for me.

29:02.040 --> 29:02.880
Since I was young,

29:02.960 --> 29:04.600
I have never once disobeyed my parents.

29:06.080 --> 29:08.280
Admission to university,
getting a job, and going abroad,

29:08.360 --> 29:09.560
were all part of the plan.

29:09.640 --> 29:11.400
Of course, this plan

29:12.040 --> 29:14.680
includes my love life and marriage.

29:17.120 --> 29:18.960
I'm more than just the pride
of my parents.

29:19.040 --> 29:20.080
My grandparents--

29:20.160 --> 29:21.320
Hey, guys.

29:21.880 --> 29:23.920
Close the door and chat inside. Okay?

29:24.400 --> 29:25.360
Thanks.

29:25.440 --> 29:27.120
-Bye.
-Take care.

29:29.600 --> 29:30.480
Let me repeat it.

29:30.560 --> 29:31.840
I understand what you are saying.

29:33.160 --> 29:34.080
But I don't understand

29:34.160 --> 29:36.680
why you came here just to tell me this.

29:36.760 --> 29:37.760
You don't understand?

29:37.840 --> 29:38.840
I don't.

29:38.920 --> 29:41.440
Since you left for France without a word,

29:41.520 --> 29:43.400
I thought we had nothing left to discuss.

29:44.080 --> 29:45.640
I went there to pave the way.

29:45.720 --> 29:46.680
For me.

29:46.760 --> 29:47.680
For the both of us.

29:47.760 --> 29:49.680
Then I understand it even less.

29:50.760 --> 29:52.840
I must first satisfy
my family's expectations.

29:52.920 --> 29:54.280
Only then can I have a bigger say

29:54.360 --> 29:55.520
in the matter of my marriage.

29:55.600 --> 29:57.920
Initially, I planned to settle down first.

29:58.000 --> 30:00.040
Then I would send you abroad
for two years of study.

30:00.120 --> 30:01.360
In this case,

30:02.400 --> 30:03.760
perhaps my family

30:06.640 --> 30:07.960
will have an easier time accepting you.

30:10.000 --> 30:10.920
Do you not believe me?

30:18.720 --> 30:19.760
Hello?

30:19.840 --> 30:20.880
Where are you?

30:20.960 --> 30:22.680
The barbecue restaurant
on the main street.

30:22.760 --> 30:23.600
Barbecue?

30:24.880 --> 30:26.320
Don't you hate that?

30:28.360 --> 30:29.720
A friend of mine reserved it.

30:29.800 --> 30:31.440
Not Wang Xixia. She went back.

30:33.880 --> 30:36.320
What's so urgent?

30:36.400 --> 30:37.800
What's wrong? Is it a bad time?

30:38.360 --> 30:39.560
-Then another day--
-It's okay.

30:41.080 --> 30:42.080
Come here.

30:42.560 --> 30:43.440
Okay.

30:44.120 --> 30:45.440
Then I'll come over now.

30:45.520 --> 30:46.360
See you later.

30:46.440 --> 30:47.360
Okay, bye.

30:56.040 --> 30:57.160
Your boyfriend?

30:59.400 --> 31:00.960
It's none of your business, right?

31:04.200 --> 31:05.560
I really didn't expect this.

31:07.480 --> 31:08.680
You moved on so fast.

31:12.040 --> 31:12.920
Ji Tong.

31:14.080 --> 31:15.600
I know you are a good negotiator,

31:15.680 --> 31:17.280
good at sophistry and reeling people in.

31:17.360 --> 31:20.680
But let me be honest with you.

31:21.560 --> 31:23.800
You are the one
who is too slow and too late.

31:23.880 --> 31:24.720
I was being cautious.

31:24.800 --> 31:26.040
You are selfish.

31:26.800 --> 31:27.840
I also am.

31:27.920 --> 31:30.760
-Zhuang Jie.
-Ji Tong, let me finish first.

31:32.400 --> 31:34.560
It has only been a few months

31:34.640 --> 31:36.080
since I made things clear to you.

31:36.160 --> 31:37.560
But for me, that was

31:38.080 --> 31:40.080
three years and half a lifetime.

31:40.720 --> 31:41.720
That's right.

31:43.000 --> 31:44.280
My recent experience

31:45.080 --> 31:47.040
was enough to turn me into another person.

31:48.120 --> 31:49.600
So now I don't care at all

31:49.680 --> 31:52.160
what your family thinks of me
or if they can accept me

31:52.240 --> 31:53.960
because I also have a family to consider.

31:54.040 --> 31:54.960
I'm very busy.

31:56.040 --> 31:58.360
The point is that you found someone else.

31:59.200 --> 32:01.000
You had better stop saying that.

32:01.080 --> 32:01.960
You sound jealous.

32:02.040 --> 32:03.000
It's an objective fact.

32:03.080 --> 32:04.960
The objective fact is
I am a disabled person.

32:05.480 --> 32:07.080
I have been ever since I was 12.

32:09.000 --> 32:11.360
So no matter how many years I spend

32:11.440 --> 32:12.320
to further my studies

32:12.400 --> 32:14.080
and to cater to
and accommodate your family,

32:14.160 --> 32:16.240
they may not be able to accept me.

32:16.320 --> 32:18.040
Zhuang Jie, relationships require effort.

32:18.120 --> 32:19.920
We can't be too calculative with the cost.

32:21.400 --> 32:23.760
Do I really need to spell it out for you?

32:24.560 --> 32:26.800
You were the one
who was being calculative first, right?

32:26.880 --> 32:29.920
If you really were sincere,

32:30.000 --> 32:32.440
really were paving the way for us,

32:33.320 --> 32:35.000
why did you run away in the first place?

32:36.760 --> 32:37.840
You kept me in the wings.

32:37.920 --> 32:39.560
Now you are not content with how it ended.

32:39.640 --> 32:41.000
This is not love.

32:41.080 --> 32:42.000
Do you understand?

32:48.320 --> 32:49.200
Okay.

32:49.280 --> 32:50.840
Let's say you are right.

32:54.320 --> 32:55.320
I'm back now.

32:56.840 --> 32:58.360
I want to get back together.

32:58.440 --> 33:00.120
I want to accept your confession.

33:00.200 --> 33:01.360
Will you accept that?

33:04.800 --> 33:06.640
I've already rejected you just now.

33:09.280 --> 33:10.360
Think about it again.

33:12.040 --> 33:13.320
Think about it some more.

33:15.880 --> 33:16.920
I'm getting some fresh air.

34:05.160 --> 34:06.360
Where is your friend?

34:06.440 --> 34:07.280
Here.

34:10.239 --> 34:11.080
What's the matter?

34:37.480 --> 34:39.000
These are medicinal patches.

34:39.080 --> 34:40.679
There is an instruction manual inside.

34:40.760 --> 34:41.880
I'm going to go.

34:41.960 --> 34:43.280
I'll call you later.

34:50.800 --> 34:52.639
Don't you know about your own condition?

34:55.800 --> 34:57.120
Have you forgotten how it hurts?

35:17.760 --> 35:18.760
That's him, right?

35:20.560 --> 35:21.480
Chen Maidong?

35:24.640 --> 35:26.120
He is Chen Maidong.

35:27.360 --> 35:28.520
This guy?

35:33.720 --> 35:34.880
Ji Tong.

35:35.440 --> 35:37.040
That's enough for tonight.

35:37.120 --> 35:38.320
Neither of us likes barbecue.

35:38.400 --> 35:39.240
It's a waste.

35:40.800 --> 35:42.280
Thank you for coming to see me.

35:42.360 --> 35:44.520
I also wish you success in the future.

35:45.480 --> 35:47.240
In the office, you are still my superior.

35:47.320 --> 35:48.520
I respect you very much.

35:48.600 --> 35:49.800
This won't change.

35:53.280 --> 35:54.440
Today, I…

35:55.040 --> 35:56.840
I was a little out of sorts today.

35:56.920 --> 35:57.840
Next time…

35:59.480 --> 36:01.000
-I'll see you home.
-No, thank you.

36:03.720 --> 36:04.960
You should go back soon.

36:08.960 --> 36:10.720
I'm not in a hurry to go back to Shanghai.

36:11.360 --> 36:13.040
Next time, we'll eat what you like.

36:59.240 --> 37:01.280
You have to block it.

37:01.360 --> 37:02.200
But I did, didn't I?

37:02.280 --> 37:05.440
-You blocked it so well. You're gone.
-I only have three, four, and five left.

37:05.520 --> 37:06.960
Tell me. Where could I go?

37:07.040 --> 37:09.400
How can I block it?
I'm four, three, four, five. How can I go?

37:10.600 --> 37:11.600
Come.

37:14.720 --> 37:15.800
-Here.
-It's so cold.

37:15.880 --> 37:16.960
You're wearing so little.

37:18.200 --> 37:19.840
His face is colder than the weather.

37:19.920 --> 37:20.840
Enough. Talk less.

37:20.920 --> 37:21.840
Deal the cards.

37:41.080 --> 37:44.600
INSTRUCTIONS FOR MEDICINAL PATCH,
ONE PATCH AT A TIME

37:50.320 --> 37:51.200
Mom?

37:51.880 --> 37:53.120
I thought you were asleep.

37:55.040 --> 37:57.520
Don't tell me you sneaked in

37:57.600 --> 37:59.360
because you were worried
about waking me up.

37:59.440 --> 38:00.680
Of course.

38:00.760 --> 38:02.720
It's not like I've done anything wrong.

38:09.280 --> 38:11.560
That guy today is called Ji Tong.

38:11.640 --> 38:12.880
He's my superior.

38:12.960 --> 38:14.680
He heard about what happened to us,

38:14.760 --> 38:15.920
so he came to visit me.

38:16.840 --> 38:17.800
Is that it?

38:17.880 --> 38:18.800
That's it.

38:20.640 --> 38:22.000
Then why did you have to come back

38:22.080 --> 38:24.080
to change your clothes
and make yourself up

38:24.160 --> 38:25.360
to go out with him?

38:27.000 --> 38:29.160
He is a colleague from Shanghai.

38:29.240 --> 38:30.680
I must be more formal.

38:30.760 --> 38:31.680
Otherwise, he'll think

38:31.760 --> 38:33.080
I'm too slipshod in my hometown.

38:33.840 --> 38:35.760
Do you think that silly Western attire

38:35.840 --> 38:37.160
will make you confident?

38:40.840 --> 38:42.480
I think that person is not good.

38:42.560 --> 38:43.400
He's too arrogant.

38:43.480 --> 38:46.320
When he smiles,
there is no warmth in his eyes.

38:46.400 --> 38:47.800
He's not like you.

38:47.880 --> 38:49.200
I know.

38:53.520 --> 38:55.760
SECRET ANCESTRAL RECIPE

38:56.400 --> 38:57.280
Jie.

38:57.920 --> 39:00.240
We are stand-up people of this town.

39:00.320 --> 39:02.120
We don't lick anyone's boots
or fear anyone.

39:03.160 --> 39:04.320
Understand?

39:14.680 --> 39:15.560
Mom.

39:16.200 --> 39:18.640
Ji Tong and I are really just colleagues.

39:19.280 --> 39:20.360
Don't worry.

39:23.120 --> 39:24.600
Okay. Sleep early.

39:24.680 --> 39:25.560
You too.

39:29.440 --> 39:30.760
Did Wang Xixia

39:30.840 --> 39:32.920
send these to you?

39:34.280 --> 39:35.200
No.

39:35.760 --> 39:37.040
A friend of mine gave it to me.

39:38.360 --> 39:39.920
Make more friends like this.

39:40.880 --> 39:42.160
From now on, forget about those

39:42.240 --> 39:44.080
who only care
about your face and not your leg.

39:58.600 --> 40:03.160
ALARM TAG: CHEN MAIDONG REMINDS YOU
TO CHANGE THE MEDICINAL PATCH

40:11.040 --> 40:13.040
INSTRUCTIONS FOR MEDICINAL PATCH

40:20.400 --> 40:21.280
Money is hard to make.

40:21.360 --> 40:22.280
Crap tastes bad.

40:23.560 --> 40:25.560
My brother-in-law
is getting married next month.

40:27.120 --> 40:29.560
I think I might have
to contribute my entire income this year.

40:30.040 --> 40:32.520
At least your money
is going back into your family.

40:32.600 --> 40:34.560
Wu Dalang chatted with me a few days ago.

40:36.120 --> 40:37.800
He was cheated big-time.

40:37.880 --> 40:38.880
Who did that?

40:38.960 --> 40:40.280
Wu Dalang is in a tough spot.

40:40.880 --> 40:42.040
His dad has a GoFundMe.

40:42.120 --> 40:43.240
My wife donated 200 to that.

40:44.200 --> 40:46.200
Hedgehog, I think.

40:46.280 --> 40:47.200
Is he out of prison?

40:47.280 --> 40:48.560
Yes.

40:48.640 --> 40:51.360
He brings his company to eat
at Wu Dalang's restaurant every day.

40:51.440 --> 40:52.680
They leave once they're done.

40:52.760 --> 40:54.000
"Put it on the tab," he says.

40:55.080 --> 40:56.800
Wu Dalang is too cowardly.

40:57.560 --> 40:59.280
He always tries to keep the peace.

40:59.360 --> 41:01.200
If it were me,
I wouldn't let Hedgehog do that.

41:01.280 --> 41:02.520
Come on.

41:02.600 --> 41:03.840
Do you think you are Maidong?

41:03.920 --> 41:05.760
He has been confrontational
since he was a kid.

41:05.840 --> 41:07.880
Stability is important for business.

41:08.560 --> 41:09.760
Stability?

41:10.600 --> 41:11.640
With people like Hedgehog,

41:11.720 --> 41:13.400
once you show your fear,
he will bully you.

41:13.480 --> 41:14.480
You have to toughen up.

41:14.560 --> 41:16.360
He fears the tough and bullies the weak.

41:17.680 --> 41:18.840
Who's that?

41:30.200 --> 41:31.040
Hedgehog.

41:32.920 --> 41:34.840
Just our luck.

41:36.280 --> 41:38.880
I heard about your game here.

41:38.960 --> 41:40.080
Let me join in the fun.

41:40.840 --> 41:42.120
Come, take my seat.

41:42.200 --> 41:43.560
Win or lose, put it on my account.

41:43.640 --> 41:45.600
Maidong and I were just going out
to buy something.

41:45.680 --> 41:47.160
Why should I play with your account?

41:48.000 --> 41:50.680
Why should I use your money?

41:51.640 --> 41:52.640
Moreover,

41:52.720 --> 41:54.320
it's not like he and I aren't friends.

41:54.400 --> 41:55.240
Right,

41:56.240 --> 41:57.200
Maidong?

42:00.600 --> 42:01.840
Maidong, come on.

42:01.920 --> 42:04.400
Xu's hardware shop closes early. Let's go.

42:06.400 --> 42:08.240
Don't be in such a hurry, Maidong.

42:11.040 --> 42:12.120
Lend me some money.

42:19.600 --> 42:20.560
Let go.

42:21.960 --> 42:22.880
What did you say?

42:24.760 --> 42:26.000
I told you to let go.

42:32.800 --> 42:34.240
Still as tough as ever, aren't you?

42:36.080 --> 42:37.080
I knew it.

42:37.960 --> 42:40.000
As expected of a guy
who deals with dead people.

42:40.080 --> 42:41.720
You're of a different breed, aren't you?

42:45.120 --> 42:46.000
Don't.

42:52.960 --> 42:54.320
What are you doing?

42:54.400 --> 42:56.240
-Don't move!
-Stop fighting!

42:56.320 --> 42:57.600
-Stop it!
-Dong!

42:58.480 --> 43:00.560
My stuff! Stop fighting!

43:01.800 --> 43:02.920
Stop!

43:03.000 --> 43:04.320
Stop fighting!

43:04.960 --> 43:06.040
Stop it!

45:19.040 --> 45:25.800
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
